000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.           TCHGBYBC.
000400 AUTHOR.               A. TREUDLER.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.         MAY 2, 1988.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.         GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
000800
000900*REMARKS.              THIS PROGRAM WILL READ THROUGH THE
001000*                      DETAIL TRANSACTION DATA SET
001100*                      AND FIND ALL ISS, ADJ, RET, RETV AND
001200*                      DCHG TRANSACTIONS AND SORT AND PRINT THEM
001300*                      IN REPORT CODE, LEDGER CODE, DEPT, CLASS,
001400*                      AND DEPT/ACCOUNT ORDER.
001500
      * 14JUN90 DAP - EXPANDED BLOWUP MESSAGE IN 510-GET-LEDGER
      *               TO GIVE MORE INFORMATION.
      *C
      *C   25FEB1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C     ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C   11SEP1995    DAVE PLUM
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO MOVE ZERO TO FIELD "STR-STD-COST" WHEN
      *C     PROCESSING A TRANSACTION FOR CODE "NON-STR".  THIS
      *C     CHANGE SHOULD PREVENT A DATA DECIMAL ERROR WHICH HAS
      *C     OCCURRED IN PARAGRAPH "600-BUILD-SORT-REC", STATEMENT
      *C     "IF STR-STD-COST = 0".
      *C
      *C    09/03/96    CA YODER
      *C     RE-COMPILED PROGRAM TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.

001600 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001700 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001800 SOURCE-COMPUTER.      HP-3000.
001900 OBJECT-COMPUTER.      HP-3000.
