053100 010-MAINLINE.
           MOVE "C" TO MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.
           CALL "MCXCBLERR" USING MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.
053200
053400*------ GET PARMS FOR REPORT
053500     ACCEPT HD-ROUTE-DATA.
           DISPLAY HD-ROUTE-DATA.
053600
           MOVE HD-SPOOLER-NUMBER TO OVRPRTF-TOFILE-NUM.
           MOVE "*YES"            TO OVRPRTF-SHARED.
           MOVE HD-NO-OF-COPIES   TO OVRPRTF-COPIES.
           MOVE "MCPRT"           TO OVRPRTF-FILE.
           PERFORM 996-OVERRIDE-PRINT-FILE.

053300     OPEN OUTPUT ONLINE-PRT.

      *------ 14APR90 REPLACED CALL TO GETFNUM WITH MACHINE
      *------ DEPENDENT ROUTINE.
054100*****CALL "GETFNUM" USING ONLINE-PRT, FNUM.

           PERFORM 9999-GETFNUM.
054200     MOVE "DHDRPT86.PUB" TO HD-FILE-NAME.
054300     CALL "THDPRT2" USING HD-RET-CODE, HD-FILE-NAME, FNUM,
054400         HD-ROUTE-DATA, ESC-NAME.
054500     IF HD-RET-CODE NOT = 0
054600         MOVE "THDPRT2 ERROR * CHGBYBC" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
054700         MOVE "HD-RET-CODE = "     TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
054800         MOVE HD-RET-CODE          TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD9 (1)
054900         PERFORM 990-BLOWUP.
055000
053700     CALL "TESCSEQ" USING ESC-NAME.
053800     MOVE CHAR-1636PI              TO COMPRESS-PRINT.
053900     MOVE CHAR-10PI                TO NORMAL-PRINT.
054000
055100     IF PAPER-IS-132-COLS
055200       NEXT SENTENCE
055300     ELSE
055400       WRITE PRT-REC FROM COMPRESS-PRINT AFTER ADVANCING 0.
055500
055600*******************************************************
055700**   CALL 'CBLOWSRT' FIRST BEFORE GOING INTO THE
055800**   SORT VERB.  THE FIRST CALL TO 'CBLOWSRT' OPENS
055900**   UP A NEW TEMPORARY FILE 'BLUPDATA' THAT IS USED
056000**   TO WRITE THE BLOWUP INFORMATION IF A BLOWUP
056100**   OCCURS
056200*******************************************************
056300
056400     CALL "CBLOWSRT" USING CBLOWSRT-PARMS,
056500                           ACCTG-BASE,
056600                           BU-PGM-NAME,
056700                           STATUS-AREA,
056800                           DUMMY-VIEW-AREA,
056900                           FILE-STATUS,
057000                           BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
057100                           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
057200
057300     SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-BC
057400                                     SORT-REPORT-CODE
057500                                     SORT-LEDG-CODE
057600                                     SORT-DEPT-CHGD
057700                                     SORT-CLASS
057800                                     SORT-DEPT-ACCT
057900                                     SORT-CODE-OR-PO
058000         INPUT PROCEDURE IS 050-PROCESS-TRANS
058100         OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS 700-CREATE-REPORT.
058200     PERFORM 1000-CLOSE-FILES.
