064900                     PERFORM 510-GET-LEDGER
065000                     PERFORM 520-GET-DESCR
065100                     PERFORM 550-GET-MSTORERM
065200                     PERFORM 600-BUILD-SORT-REC
065300                 ELSE
065400                     NEXT SENTENCE
065500             ELSE
065600                 NEXT SENTENCE.
