               MOVE TRANS-STORES-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
               MOVE TRANS-DATE        TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
               MOVE TRANS-TIME        TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4)
               MOVE TRANS-CODE        TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (5)
076200         PERFORM 990-BLOWUP.
076300
