077500             MOVE "N"             TO CDESC-LOCAL-DESC-OPTION
077600             CALL "CDESC" USING CDESC-RET-CODE
077700                                STORES-BASE
077800                                STATUS-AREA
077900                                BU-DISPLAY-MSG
078000                                TRANS-STORES-CODE
078100                                CDESC-DATA
078200             MOVE CDESC (1)       TO SORT-DESCR.
078300
078400 530-GET-PO-DESCR.
078500     MOVE "P" TO KEY-REC-ID.
078600     MOVE TRANS-ORDER-NUM TO KEY-PO-NO.
078700     MOVE TRANS-RELEASE TO KEY-PO-REL.
078800     MOVE "000" TO KEY-PO-REC.
           PERFORM 9999-DBFIND-DPODATAITM-PO-I.
079500     IF GOOD-CALL
079600         PERFORM 540-CONT-DESCR UNTIL ITEM-FOUND = 1
079700                    OR END-OF-CHAIN
079800         MOVE 0 TO ITEM-FOUND
079900     ELSE
080000         IF NO-ENTRY
080100              DISPLAY "NO FIND FOR PO NUM " PO-KEY-ARG
080200         ELSE
