084900                 MOVE MMATL-CODE-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
085000                 PERFORM 990-BLOWUP.
085100
085200 600-BUILD-SORT-REC.
085300     MOVE TRANS-DEPT              TO SORT-DEPT-CHGD.
085400     MOVE TRANS-ACCT              TO SORT-ACCT-CHGD.
085500     MOVE TRANS-CLASS             TO SORT-CLASS.
085600     IF TRANS-STORES-CODE = "NON-STR"
085700         MOVE TRANS-ORDER-NUM     TO SORT-CODE-OR-PO
085800         MOVE TRANS-RELEASE       TO SORT-PO-RLS
085900         MOVE TRANS-ITEM-NUM      TO SORT-PO-ITEM
086000     ELSE
