129900 750-PRINT-HEADINGS.
      *************************************************************
      * IF PRINT-FILE-CTR IS GREATER THAN 100 THEN CLOSE AND REOPEN
      * THE PRINT FILE, SO THAT WE DON'T GET INTO SPOOLFILE SIZE
      * PROBLEMS.
      *************************************************************
           ADD 1 TO PRINT-FILE-CTR.
           IF PRINT-FILE-CTR IS GREATER THAN 100
               MOVE 1 TO PRINT-FILE-CTR
               CLOSE ONLINE-PRT
               OPEN OUTPUT ONLINE-PRT.

           MOVE 1 TO DATE-MODE.
           CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
130000*****MOVE CURRENT-DATE TO DATE-H1.
